WEBVTT

00:00:19.266 --> 00:00:20.267
Papa.

00:00:33.739 --> 00:00:35.366
"Kids Club."

00:00:35.991 --> 00:00:37.618
What's a kids club?

00:00:48.587 --> 00:00:50.798
-Fish.
-That's right, dear.

00:00:51.257 --> 00:00:52.675
I'm still not sure I understand.

00:00:52.758 --> 00:00:56.345
You take my kids, all day, on purpose?

00:00:56.428 --> 00:00:57.555
Fish.

00:00:57.721 --> 00:00:58.806
That's right.

00:00:58.889 --> 00:01:01.100
What exactly don't you understand?

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:02.351
Why?

00:01:02.893 --> 00:01:06.564
So they can have a great time,
and you can have a great time.

00:01:07.982 --> 00:01:09.024
Fish.

00:01:09.733 --> 00:01:12.528
Don't worry, you get them back
at the end of the day.

00:01:13.654 --> 00:01:14.738
Fish.

00:01:14.822 --> 00:01:16.615
Oh, well. That's better than nothing.

00:01:27.001 --> 00:01:28.002
So...

00:01:28.085 --> 00:01:29.545
What do we do now?

00:01:29.628 --> 00:01:34.091
I think we do whatever we want.

00:01:35.134 --> 00:01:37.094
"Whatever we want"?

00:01:37.428 --> 00:01:39.054
Whatever we want.

00:01:39.305 --> 00:01:41.891
-Whatever we want.
-Whatever we want!

00:01:41.974 --> 00:01:45.895
Whatever we want.

00:01:45.978 --> 00:01:48.647
-Stop! Help me!
-Whatever we want.

00:01:48.731 --> 00:01:50.774
-Whatever we want.
-Whatever we want.

00:01:51.859 --> 00:01:53.360
Hi. Hello.

00:01:53.444 --> 00:01:54.653
How y'all doin'?

00:01:54.737 --> 00:01:55.905
Good evening, Captain.

00:01:55.988 --> 00:01:57.907
Well, hello. Oh, my goodness.

00:02:00.034 --> 00:02:03.954
Would you mind lifting your tail?
You know...

00:02:04.246 --> 00:02:07.374
-Certainly.
-Okay. Thank you so much.

00:02:09.627 --> 00:02:10.836
Hello.

00:02:11.212 --> 00:02:12.296
Welcome aboard.

00:02:39.657 --> 00:02:43.035
You were so right, Great-Grandfather.

00:02:43.118 --> 00:02:45.788
Monsters are disgusting!

00:02:45.996 --> 00:02:47.915
They're animals!

00:03:04.848 --> 00:03:06.433
I'll be right there.

00:03:14.775 --> 00:03:17.069
Dracula, is he on board?

00:03:17.152 --> 00:03:19.822
Yes. I saw him. Face-to-face.

00:03:20.531 --> 00:03:21.991
I was so nice to him.

00:03:22.074 --> 00:03:24.368
That pale face of his
and his goofy smile,

00:03:24.451 --> 00:03:25.995
showing off his fangs.

00:03:26.078 --> 00:03:27.830
It's just like you taught me!

00:03:27.913 --> 00:03:30.332
It's even worse than I feared!

00:03:30.416 --> 00:03:33.585
It was that fateful night
that I realized

00:03:33.669 --> 00:03:37.089
a human could never defeat a monster.

00:03:41.302 --> 00:03:44.680
But I wouldn't let
our family legacy die.

00:03:45.431 --> 00:03:50.019
And so, I began to search for an answer.

00:03:50.102 --> 00:03:55.357
And I saw it in an ancient text,
an instrument of destruction

00:03:55.441 --> 00:03:57.651
so powerful it destroyed Atlantis,

00:03:57.735 --> 00:04:00.779
a whole city of monsters.

00:04:01.739 --> 00:04:05.868
And there, deep within the rubble,
it lay, waiting.

00:04:06.076 --> 00:04:09.621
Endlessly, I searched for the lost city.

00:04:09.705 --> 00:04:13.250
Time passed,
and my body began to fail me.

00:04:13.625 --> 00:04:15.878
It was so sad, Ericka.

00:04:15.961 --> 00:04:18.505
First my liver, then my spleen,

00:04:18.589 --> 00:04:20.883
followed by a kidney or two.

00:04:21.175 --> 00:04:23.218
Then my golden locks.

00:04:24.762 --> 00:04:27.348
But I wouldn't let that stop me.

00:04:27.431 --> 00:04:32.311
I replaced my failing organs
with technology!

00:04:34.021 --> 00:04:35.814
And look at me now.

00:04:38.275 --> 00:04:40.486
Girl, it's an improvement, really.

00:04:42.279 --> 00:04:43.405
Sure.

00:04:44.365 --> 00:04:49.161
And now, after 120 years,
I have finally found Atlantis.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:51.330
Forget about all this!

00:04:51.413 --> 00:04:52.831
Let me get rid of Dracula right now.

00:04:52.915 --> 00:04:54.625
I was so close to him,
I could've just...

00:04:56.585 --> 00:04:58.754
No, no, no!

00:04:59.171 --> 00:05:01.131
We have to stick to the plan.

00:05:01.215 --> 00:05:05.427
Lure the monsters to Atlantis,
retrieve the instrument of destruction,

00:05:05.511 --> 00:05:08.263
trap them there, and then wipe them out.

00:05:08.347 --> 00:05:09.890
It's simple, Ericka!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:13.143
Now, promise me
you won't try and kill Dracula.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:14.645
Fine!

00:05:14.728 --> 00:05:16.855
-I promise.
-Promise what?

00:05:17.564 --> 00:05:20.609
I promise I won't try
and kill Dracula. Okay?

00:05:27.533 --> 00:05:31.120
Don't worry, Great-Grandfather,
I won't try and kill him...

00:05:31.203 --> 00:05:32.913
I will kill him.

